   "title": "Don’t disappoint Nigeria’s founding fathers, Jonathan warns political leaders",
   "url": "https://www.vanguardngr.com/2026/11/dont-disappoint-nigerias-founding-fathers-jonathan-warns-political-leaders/",
   "domain": "vanguardngr.com",
