   "title": "Internet Society of Ghana President urges Ghanaians to be responsible online, warns against social media overuse",
   "url": "https://www.myjoyonline.com/internet-society-of-ghana-president-urges-ghanaians-to-be-responsible-online-warns-against-social-media-overuse/",
   "domain": "myjoyonline.com",
