   "title": "US appears to have pushed China and Russia out of Venezuelan oil deals but faces a billionaire's growing grip on prized African crude",
   "url": "https://africa.businessinsider.com/local/markets/us-appears-to-have-pushed-china-and-russia-out-of-venezuelan-oil-deals-but-faces-a/clq3vmw",
