   "title": "Mahanadi Coalfields files RHP for proposed IPO worth nearly ₹9,500 crore",
   "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/business/markets/mahanadi-coalfields-files-rhp-for-proposed-ipo-worth-nearly-9500-crore/article71702765.ece",
