   "title": "Fani-Kayode presents Letter of Credence to Ramaphosa, formally assumes duty as ambassador",
   "url": "https://www.premiumtimesng.com/news/headlines/924952-fani-kayode-presents-letter-of-credence-to-ramaphosa-formally-assumes-duty-as-ambassador.html",
   "domain": "premiumtimesng.com",
